<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS - BHP copper production rises in Sept.</title>
<headline>RTRS - BHP copper production rises in Sept.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Broken Hill Pty Co Ltd said on Friday its production of copper in concentrate, copper cathodes and copper anodes rose in September compared with September 1995.</p>
<p>The rise reflected the Phase Three expansion of its 57.5 percent owned La Escondida mine in Chile and the acquisition of Magma Copper last January, BHP said in its September production report.</p>
<p>Copper in concentrate output from Ok Tedi in Papua New Guinea (PNG) was in line with September 1995 but year-to-date output was lower due to lower mill throughput and recoveries.  </p>
